	# ---- Nutaku F2P story: chapters, goals, rival bids. {n} = the goal's need, {target}/{hours} = the bid's; filled by f2p_ui.gd
	"f2p_ch_c1_title": "One lit floor",
	"f2p_ch_c1_intro": "Harbour Street has five floors and one working light. Mirei hands you the keys and a list of tenants who left. Across the street, Castellan Voss raises a glass from his window. 'Give it a month,' he mouths.",
	"f2p_ch_c1_g0": "Open {n} floors",
	"f2p_ch_c1_g1": "Get one floor to a {n}-link chain",
	"f2p_ch_c1_g2": "Earn {n} affection tiers with anyone",
	"f2p_ch_c1_outro": "Three floors lit. Mirei doesn't say well done; she leaves a second coffee on your desk, which is the same thing.",
	"f2p_ch_c2_title": "The fire inspection",
	"f2p_ch_c2_intro": "Someone called the city. Inspector Kaminski arrives with a clipboard and no expression. 'Every floor full enough to be supervised, and nobody on this building working next to a man who talks through their headphones.' Voss sends flowers. The card says 'Good luck.'",
	"f2p_ch_c2_g0": "Open all {n} floors",
	"f2p_ch_c2_g1": "Pass inspection: every floor holds {n}+ pieces and no floor pays Wes's tax",
	"f2p_ch_c2_g2": "Beat Voss's bid for the lease",
	"f2p_ch_c2_boss_title": "Voss bids for the lease",
	"f2p_ch_c2_boss_text": "Voss offers Mirei {target} for the lease, in writing, with a pen he leaves behind. Show her the building is worth more: earn {target} in the next {hours} hours.",
	"f2p_ch_c2_outro": "Kaminski signs the certificate. Mirei tears Voss's offer in half and keeps his pen. 'We're buying the Glass Tower,' she says. 'Sell this one on your way out.'",
	"f2p_ch_c3_title": "Glass and debt",
	"f2p_ch_c3_intro": "The Glass Tower is beautiful and owes money to Pike Harlan Capital. Ms. Arden visits with a tablet and a smile. 'We'd simply like to be kept informed.' Everyone can see into every floor, which means everyone can see which floors are empty.",
	"f2p_ch_c3_g0": "Open {n} floors",
	"f2p_ch_c3_g1": "{n} fit-out levels across the tower",
	"f2p_ch_c3_g2": "{n} staff on the roster",
	"f2p_ch_c3_outro": "Arden's tablet shows your numbers going up. She stops smiling, which is the first honest thing she has done.",
	"f2p_ch_c4_title": "The walkout",
	"f2p_ch_c4_intro": "The night staff walk out at midnight, together, politely: better chairs, better coffee, and someone who listens. They're right. Pike's fund calls the walkout 'a default event' and starts drafting a bid.",
	"f2p_ch_c4_g0": "Fit out every floor to level {n} (better chairs)",
	"f2p_ch_c4_g1": "Finish {n} staff requests (someone who listens)",
	"f2p_ch_c4_g2": "Open all {n} floors",
	"f2p_ch_c4_g3": "Beat Pike Harlan's bid",
	"f2p_ch_c4_boss_title": "Pike Harlan's bid",
	"f2p_ch_c4_boss_text": "Arden files a bid for the tower's debt: {target}, due in {hours} hours unless the building makes it first. Make it first.",
	"f2p_ch_c4_outro": "The staff come back on a Tuesday with cake. Pike's bid expires unanswered. Mirei has already found the next building, in the night market.",
	"f2p_ch_c5_title": "Lanterns",
	"f2p_ch_c5_intro": "Night Market Lofts: paper lanterns, noodle steam, and a Voss & Daughters sign going up on every other building on the lane. Voss has been buying the market while you were in the tower.",
	"f2p_ch_c5_g0": "Open {n} floors",
	"f2p_ch_c5_g1": "{n} affection tiers in total",
	"f2p_ch_c5_g2": "Get one floor to a {n}-link chain",
	"f2p_ch_c5_outro": "The lane votes on which building hosts the lantern festival. It is not the one with Voss's sign on it.",
	"f2p_ch_c6_title": "The noise complaint",
	"f2p_ch_c6_intro": "A noise complaint, filed by a tenant who turns out to work for Voss. Kaminski is back, apologetic. 'Rules are rules. Quiet floors, full floors, or I close you for the festival.'",
	"f2p_ch_c6_g0": "Open all {n} floors",
	"f2p_ch_c6_g1": "No floor pays Wes's tax (quiet floors)",
	"f2p_ch_c6_g2": "Every floor holds {n}+ pieces",
	"f2p_ch_c6_g3": "Win the bidding war for the lane",
	"f2p_ch_c6_boss_title": "The bidding war",
	"f2p_ch_c6_boss_text": "Voss bids for the whole lane, Lofts included: {target}. The lane's owners give you {hours} hours to match it from the building's own earnings.",
	"f2p_ch_c6_outro": "The festival goes ahead. Voss attends, in a very good suit, and buys a lantern from Priya without making eye contact.",
	"f2p_ch_c7_title": "The Meridian",
	"f2p_ch_c7_intro": "The Meridian is a real office tower: lobbies, lifts, a fountain nobody turns off. Pike Harlan owns the building next door and has pointed its boardroom window at yours.",
	"f2p_ch_c7_g0": "Open {n} floors",
	"f2p_ch_c7_g1": "Staff ranks adding up to {n}",
	"f2p_ch_c7_g2": "{n} fit-out levels across the building",
	"f2p_ch_c7_outro": "Arden sends a fruit basket with no card. Mara scans it for bugs anyway. There are two.",
	"f2p_ch_c8_title": "Hostile takeover",
	"f2p_ch_c8_intro": "Pike Harlan starts buying Meridian debt on the open market. To fight a takeover the building has to look like a building worth keeping: Nia wants every floor brought up to standard before the fund moves.",
	"f2p_ch_c8_g0": "Open all {n} floors",
	"f2p_ch_c8_g1": "The audit: every floor fitted out to level {n}",
	"f2p_ch_c8_g2": "Beat the hostile takeover",
	"f2p_ch_c8_boss_title": "The takeover",
	"f2p_ch_c8_boss_text": "The fund tables its offer: {target} for the Meridian's debt. Out-earn it in {hours} hours and the board will not sell.",
	"f2p_ch_c8_outro": "The board declines Pike Harlan's offer by a vote of seven to nothing. Arden, to everyone's surprise, sends her resignation to Mirei, with a CV.",
	"f2p_ch_c9_title": "Occupancy One",
	"f2p_ch_c9_intro": "The tower. Forty floors on the skyline, nine you can reach, all of them dark. Voss owns the tower's ground lease and has never once let anyone build above the lobby.",
	"f2p_ch_c9_g0": "Open {n} floors",
	"f2p_ch_c9_g1": "{n} affection tiers in total",
	"f2p_ch_c9_g2": "Take {n} an hour",
	"f2p_ch_c9_outro": "The tower's windows light up floor by floor, and the whole city can see it. So can Voss.",
	"f2p_ch_c10_title": "Keys to the city",
	"f2p_ch_c10_intro": "Voss and Pike Harlan, together for once: a joint bid for the ground lease, the tower and everything under it. It is the biggest number anyone has said out loud on this street.",
	"f2p_ch_c10_g0": "Open all {n} floors",
	"f2p_ch_c10_g1": "{n} affection tiers in total",
	"f2p_ch_c10_g2": "Beat the joint bid",
	"f2p_ch_c10_boss_title": "The joint bid",
	"f2p_ch_c10_boss_text": "{target}, from both of them, due in {hours} hours. The tower has to out-earn its own price.",
	"f2p_ch_c10_outro": "The bid fails. Voss crosses the street for the first time in twenty years, shakes Mirei's hand, then yours, and asks whether the top floor is taken. It is. Everyone you met on the way up is on it, and the night is warm.",
},
